  "final_text": "**Proposed disposition:** ESCALATE, confidence 0.70. The proposal is on file as case C-A-261028-0010.\n\n**Three facts that drove it**\n1. The trader placed a one-sided SELL limit of 31,395 (12.9x top-5 depth, 3 ticks from the touch). It had no fills and was cancelled in full.\n2. The trader bought 1,053 by market order at 16:05:20.314 and cancelled the SELL 158 ms later. The price moved 0.5 ticks in the trader's favour and reverted 2.5 ticks after the cancel.\n3. No legitimate explanation holds. The trader is a registered market maker only on SYN.B, not SYN.A. There was no two-sided quoting, no market event and no risk event, and the trader has no prior alerts.\n\n**What would change my mind:** evidence that the SELL was a genuine client or parent order, or that the 0.5-tick move had another cause. Repeated cycles would move this toward DRAFT_STOR. I saw only one cycle, so I did not propose a STOR draft.",
